---
import Section from "./Section.astro";
import ProcessStrip from "./ProcessStrip.astro";
---

<Section id="about" label="About">
  <div class="space-y-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-muted text-pretty">
    <p>
      I have been building software for over seven years, web platforms, mobile
      apps and the backend systems behind them.
    </p>

    <p>
      What I enjoy most is the messy beginning of a project, when the problem is
      still vague. Asking the questions that make it concrete, weighing the
      options, writing the design doc, and breaking it into something a team can
      actually ship.
    </p>

    <p>
      Then I like to follow it all the way down. In my last few roles I have
      owned features end to end: the requirements, the system design, the
      implementation plan, the tests, the release, and whatever breaks
      afterwards.
    </p>

    <p class="text-text">
      I care about code that the next person can pick up without needing me to
      explain it.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ProcessStrip />
</Section>
